{
  "_readme": "Golden canonical signing payloads. These bytes back every certification signature, so they are pinned here and read by the in-repo golden test, the netstandard2.0 parity probe (scripts/ns20-canonical-bytes-probe.sh) and the .NET 9 runtime probe (scripts/portability/net9-probe.sh) - one constant, three readers. To regenerate a case deliberately, copy the actual payload the failing test prints into this file. Regenerate ONLY when the canonical form is deliberately changed, and understand that changing it invalidates every signature already written. Doubles are deliberately restricted to exactly representable values: decimal formatting of arbitrary doubles is not yet identical across the targets this package ships for.",
